  <FactionDef ParentName="FactionBase">
    <defName>BX_SovereignsCaligo</defName>
    <label>sovereigns of caligo</label>
    <categoryTag>BX_CaligoCult</categoryTag>
    <description>An ultratech cult devoted to Caligo and the entropic demons of the Fold. Their society is governed by a harsh, rigid hierarchy where an individual's worth is measured solely by psychic sensitivity and psylink level.

Stripped of traditional mercy, laws, or nobility titles, they divide humanity into three absolute castes. At the apex stand the Warlocks—Bernaels and power-consumed humans who act as direct conduits for Caligo's will. Beneath them are the Renegades, former Imperial psionics and rimworld prodigies who joined to shatter Imperial restraints, freely incinerating minds and siphoning souls. At the very bottom languish the Vessels: nameless, rightless non-psionics and captives reduced to living shields and biological batteries for their superiors.

Worshipping the cursed flame as Caligo's direct manifestation, they view the psychically blind not as people, but as mere resources to be harvested.</description>
    <pawnSingular>cultist</pawnSingular>
    <pawnsPlural>cultists</pawnsPlural>
    <settlementGenerationWeight>0.5</settlementGenerationWeight>
    <requiredCountAtGameStart>1</requiredCountAtGameStart>
