    <ideoName>Psionic Supremacy</ideoName>
    <ideoDescription>Mind is absolute, flesh is secondary. All material reality is perceived as an imperfect layer dominated by the Fold—a measurable psychic space and the source of true energy.

Sentient beings with psychic potential are born to command and evolve. Ordinary people without psychic abilities lack spiritual meaning and are viewed as mere resources, slaves, or fuel for rituals. The cult reveres entropic demons born from spatial rifts in the Fold and worships the cursed flame as a direct manifestation of Caligo.</ideoDescription>
